Title: The Last Shift

[[Characters: Mara Quinn, 28-30, an ER doctor, the female lead. Jun Park, 30, the man who left her, the male lead. Ivy Chen, 27, Jun's assistant, supporting.]]

# Episode 1

INT. EMERGENCY ROOM - DAY #1-1#

Dusk. Low sun through the blinds as stretchers roll in. Mara meets the first one.

MARA
(shouting)
Bed three, charge the paddles!

NURSES
On it!

The long tone of a heart monitor.

EXT. HOSPITAL ENTRANCE - NIGHT #1-2#

Rain. Jun waits under an umbrella.

JUN
Mara. I'm back.

MARA
(cold)
It was raining when you left, too.

# Episode 2

INT. JUN'S OFFICE - DAY #2-1#

Jun stares at a missed call on his phone. Ivy waits by the door.

IVY
Mr. Park, she still won't answer.

MARA (V.O.)
Stop calling me.

JUN
Then pick up.
